#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:5
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "矩形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:8
msgid "Create rectangle"
msgstr "创建矩形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:12
msgid ""
"To draw more easily, the folio grid can be displayed from **Display > "
"Display the grid** or from `toolbar`_ icon |grid|."
msgstr ""
"为了更方便地绘制，folio网格可以从 **Display > 显示网格** 或 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 图标 |grid| 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:20
msgid "grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:14
msgid "The rectangle can only be added to the `workspace`_ by `toolbar`_."
msgstr "矩形只能由 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:16
msgid "Select the icon |rectangle| from `toolbar`_ to add a rectangle."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |rectangle| 添加矩形 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:21
msgid "rectangle"
msgstr "矩形"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:17
msgid "Click on the initial vertex from the rectangle."
msgstr "点击矩形的初始顶点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:18
msgid "Click on the end vertex from the rectangle."
msgstr "从矩形上点击端顶点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > Add** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:28
msgid "Rectangle properties"
msgstr "矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:30
msgid ""
"The edges and the internal area from the triangle can be customized at "
"QElectroTech."
msgstr "三角形的边缘和内部区域可以在QEelectroTech定制。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:32
msgid "The edges from a rectangle have the same properties as a `line`_."
msgstr "来自矩形的边缘具有与 `线条 <line_>`_ 相同的属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:33
msgid ""
"The type of filling for closed primitive objects (rectangle, ellipse and "
"closed polygon) are: **None**, **Solid line** and some types of grids."
msgstr "闭合原始物体(矩形，椭圆形和闭合多边形)的填充类型为：**None**,**Solid line** 和一些类型的网格。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Color selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 颜色选择 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:40
msgid "The possible filling colors are defined by the `RGB scale range`_."
msgstr "可能的填充颜色由 `RGB比例范围 <RGB scale range_>`_ 定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:44
msgid ""
"The position from the rectangle can be locked to prevent involuntary "
"movement. To unlock, go to rectangle properties and check the **Lock "
"position** button."
msgstr "矩形的位置可以被锁定以防止非自愿移动。要解锁，去检查矩形属性并检查 **Lock 位置** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:46
msgid ""
"The rectangle properties can be displayed from `menu bar`_, by right click "
"on one rectangle edge, from selection properties panel and using keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr "矩形属性可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 显示，通过右键点击一个矩形边缘，从选择属性面板和使用键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:50
msgid "Rectangle properties from menu bar"
msgstr "菜单栏的矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:52
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:90
msgid "Select one of the edges from the rectangle which should be edited."
msgstr "从矩形中选择要编辑的边 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit the selected object** menu item to display the "
"rectangle properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 编辑选定的对象** 菜单项以显示矩形属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:58
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:61
msgid "Rectangle properties by right click"
msgstr "通过右键点击矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:63
msgid ""
"Right click on one of the edges from the rectangle which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击应当编辑的矩形边缘之一。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit the selected object** to display the rectangle "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择选项 **编辑选定对象** 以显示矩形属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:69
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech rectangle selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 矩形选择 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:72
msgid "Rectangle properties from selection properties panel"
msgstr "选择属性面板的矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select one of the edges from the rectangle which should be edited and the "
"properties from the rectangle will appear at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr "在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 上选择一个应编辑的矩形边缘，并显示矩形属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:79
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Rectangle properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech矩形属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:83
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:86
msgid "Rectangle properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键的矩形属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:88
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:91
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the rectangle properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示矩形属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/rectangle.rst:95
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
